Functional tests

Test	Expected result
Submit with under 10 characters	Friendly validation message, no request sent
Panels slider at 2 and 8	Correct number of panels rendered
Each genre and style	Request succeeds and output matches the choices
Print button	Only the comic appears (controls hidden)
Save as JSON	Valid file downloads with a sanitized filename

API tests

Valid request returns 200 with a title and the requested number of panels
Invalid input returns 422
Gemini failure or timeout returns a clear error, and the UI shows it and restores the placeholders

Non-functional tests

Responsive: check at 360px, 768px and 1280px widths
Accessibility: keyboard-only navigation, screen reader announcements, contrast
Performance: measure generation time for 2, 4 and 8 panels
Browsers: Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge
Security: confirm the API key never appears in browser network calls, and check prompt-injection and inappropriate-content handling

Bug tracking: log issues in a simple table (ID, description, severity, status) or GitHub Issues.
